  "body": "## Reproduced; actual-merge certification pending\nv16.47 closes the proposed saturated-root construction for the three-internal-vertex chain family. The general proof repairs the inner subtree in a fixed palette, then uses clone-before-delete and label-role exchanges to keep inner profiles exact while the root carries at most one unit of deviation. Combined with v16.46, it covers all admitted chains of three internal vertices, arbitrary degrees>=2 and k>=2. Universal retained-tree barriers remain unresolved.\n\n- Verified integrated parent:b44d51a7dc8dd1718c6a033db0fdbcaca03b497f.\n- Immutable prospective protocol:259e63e44d2eab342d8370ec79d0b85d0d9b25b9.\n- [Prospective RED run](https://github.com/proteinfoldingengine/WetLabEngine/actions/runs/36815349048) atca55251c684454054c16799287c4520880bdb79e demonstrated the inherited saturated-path failure and missing-coverage mutation before implementation; exact API ZIP and extracted evidence retained.\n- Reviewed source:33dd11fff715a9762b9749d9ba2c3f88da919e3e.\n- Publication head:8c3379e57baa46f93fcb0e60c23a6c1e4c237b5f; tree513ae93c0810e8f2787da0f05c1ed6dd2c732c4e.\n- [Full science and fresh independent reproduction](https://github.com/proteinfoldingengine/WetLabEngine/actions/runs/36815871255).\n-762 passing checks:675 inherited +87 new. Complete fresh parent46/nested science,27 scientific files.\n- Same nine graphs as parent46:233,623 states,1,575,173 edges,60 profiles,528 component pairs. All graph records match the fresh parent byte-for-byte.\n-168 successful canonical representative repairs, including84 saturated representatives. Zero construction failures; zero nonunit pairs.\n-205 published manifest members audited against SHA256 and Git blobs. Both raw API artifact archives retained losslessly; source unchanged; scientific bytes agree across distinct concurrent runners.\n-1,603 source/input paths reconstructed from1,373 unique source objects with complete Git bindings.\n\nThe new evidence is the saturated construction and its paths. Prior finite unit connectivity was disclosed, not treated as a blind discovery. Primary B1/Binf/Bs remain independent scalar minima, LEX separate. No arbitrary-tree, longer-chain or physical interpretation is claimed.\n\nIndependent proof/source and artifact reviews, exact-head merge, actual-merge replay and durable receipt must all be complete before CLOSED/CERTIFIED.",
  "changed_files": 207,
